      },
      "options": {
        "content": "## What to Watch\n- CPU or Memory > 85% sustained\n- Disk usage > 85% (/, AnishSSD, Time Machine)\n- Ping loss > 2% or latency spikes\n- Wi\u2011Fi RSSI below -70 dBm or SNR below 20 dB\n",
        "mode": "markdown"
      },
      "title": "What to Watch",
      "type": "text"
    },
    {
      "description": "Navigation hub for all dashboards.",
      "gridPos": {
        "h": 6,
        "w": 24,
        "x": 0,
        "y": 4
      },
      "options": {
        "content": "## Dashboards\n- [Executive Summary](#/d/exec-summary/executive-summary3a-anish-laptop)\n- [Mac System: Core Health](#/d/mac-system-all/mac-system3a-core-health)\n- [Mac Network: Connectivity & Wi\u2011Fi](#/d/mac-network/mac-network3a-connectivity-and-wie28091-fi)\n- [Mac Info: Identity & Status](#/d/mac-info/mac-info3a-identity-and-status)\n- [All Metrics: Live Explorer](#/d/all-metrics-full/all-metrics3a-live-explorer)\n\n**Retention:** 14 days, 20 GB cap.",
        "mode": "markdown"
      },
      "title": "Quick Links",
      "type": "text"
    },
    {
      "description": "Current CPU utilization.",
      "fieldConfig": {
        "defaults": {
          "max": 100,
          "min": 0,
          "thresholds": {
            "mode": "absolute",
            "steps": [
              {
                "color": "green",
                "value": null
              },
              {
                "color": "yellow",
                "value": 70
              },
              {
                "color": "red",
                "value": 85
              }
            ]
          },
          "unit": "percent"
        }
      },
      "gridPos": {
        "h": 4,
        "w": 4,
        "x": 0,
        "y": 10
      },
      "options": {
        "graphMode": "area",
        "reduceOptions": {
          "calcs": [
            "lastNotNull"
          ],
          "fields": "",
          "values": false
        }
      },
      "targets": [
        {
          "expr": "(1 - avg(rate(node_cpu_seconds_total{mode=\"idle\"}[5m])) by (instance)) * 100"
        }
      ],
      "title": "CPU %",
      "type": "stat"
    },
    {
      "description": "RAM usage percentage.",
      "fieldConfig": {
        "defaults": {
          "max": 100,
          "min": 0,
          "thresholds": {
            "mode": "absolute",
            "steps": [
              {
                "color": "green",
                "value": null
              },
              {
                "color": "yellow",
                "value": 70
              },
              {
                "color": "red",
                "value": 85
              }
            ]
          },
          "unit": "percent"
        }
      },
      "gridPos": {
        "h": 4,
        "w": 4,
        "x": 4,
        "y": 10
      },
      "options": {
        "graphMode": "area",
        "reduceOptions": {
          "calcs": [
            "lastNotNull"
          ],
          "fields": "",
          "values": false
        }
      },
      "targets": [
        {
          "expr": "(node_memory_total_bytes - node_memory_free_bytes - node_memory_inactive_bytes - node_memory_purgeable_bytes) / node_memory_total_bytes * 100"
        }
      ],
      "title": "Memory %",
      "type": "stat"
    },
    {
      "description": "Primary disk usage.",
      "fieldConfig": {
        "defaults": {
          "max": 100,
          "min": 0,
          "thresholds": {
            "mode": "absolute",
            "steps": [
              {
                "color": "green",
                "value": null
              },
              {
                "color": "yellow",
                "value": 70
              },
              {
                "color": "red",
                "value": 85
              }
            ]
          },
          "unit": "percent"
        }
      },
      "gridPos": {
        "h": 4,
        "w": 4,
        "x": 8,
        "y": 10
      },
      "options": {
        "graphMode": "area",
        "reduceOptions": {
          "calcs": [
            "lastNotNull"
          ],
          "fields": "",
          "values": false
        }
      },
      "targets": [
        {
          "expr": "(node_filesystem_size_bytes{mountpoint=\"/\"} - node_filesystem_avail_bytes{mountpoint=\"/\"}) / node_filesystem_size_bytes{mountpoint=\"/\"} * 100"
        }
      ],
      "title": "Disk / %",
      "type": "stat"
    },
    {
      "description": "Packet loss to public targets.",
      "fieldConfig": {
        "defaults": {
          "max": 100,
          "min": 0,
          "thresholds": {
            "mode": "absolute",
            "steps": [
              {
                "color": "green",
                "value": null
              },
              {
                "color": "yellow",
                "value": 1
              },
              {
                "color": "red",
                "value": 3
              }
            ]
          },
          "unit": "percent"
        }
      },
      "gridPos": {
        "h": 4,
        "w": 4,
        "x": 12,
        "y": 10
      },
      "options": {
        "graphMode": "area",
        "reduceOptions": {
          "calcs": [
            "lastNotNull"
          ],
          "fields": "",
          "values": false
        }
      },
      "targets": [
        {
          "expr": "max(net_ping_loss_percent)"
        }
      ],
      "title": "Ping Loss",
      "type": "stat"
    },
    {
      "description": "Total inbound/outbound bandwidth.",
      "fieldConfig": {
        "defaults": {
          "min": 0,
          "unit": "Bps"
        }
      },
      "gridPos": {
        "h": 7,
        "w": 12,
        "x": 0,
        "y": 14
      },
      "targets": [
        {
          "expr": "sum(rate(node_network_receive_bytes_total[5m]))",
          "legendFormat": "RX"
        },
        {
          "expr": "sum(rate(node_network_transmit_bytes_total[5m]))",
          "legendFormat": "TX"
        }
      ],
      "title": "Network Throughput (bytes/s)",
      "type": "timeseries"
    },
    {
      "description": "Wi\u2011Fi signal strength trend.",
      "fieldConfig": {
        "defaults": {
          "unit": "dBm"
        }
      },
      "gridPos": {
        "h": 7,
        "w": 12,
        "x": 12,
        "y": 14
      },
      "targets": [
        {
          "expr": "wifi_rssi_dbm",
          "legendFormat": "{{ssid}}"
        }
      ],
      "title": "Wi\u2011Fi Signal (RSSI)",
      "type": "timeseries"
    },
    {
      "description": "Seconds since last scrape; higher means data is stale.",
      "fieldConfig": {
        "defaults": {
          "min": 0,
          "thresholds": {
            "mode": "absolute",
            "steps": [
              {
                "color": "green",
                "value": null
              },
              {
                "color": "yellow",
                "value": 30
              },
              {
                "color": "red",
                "value": 120
              }
            ]
          },
          "unit": "s"
        }
      },
      "gridPos": {
        "h": 4,
        "w": 4,
        "x": 20,
        "y": 4
      },
      "targets": [
        {
          "expr": "time() - max(timestamp(node_cpu_seconds_total))"
        }
      ],
      "title": "Data Freshness (sec)",
      "type": "stat"
    }
  ],
